.TH CHM-RETRO-MEDIA-BUILD 1
.SH NAME
chm-retro-media-build \- create and inspect Amiga ADF and Commodore D64 starter disks
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B retro/commodore/create-retro-media.sh
.RI [ --out DIRECTORY ]
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --out DIRECTORY
Directory receiving ADF, D64 and SHA256SUMS files.
.TP
.B -h, --help
Show usage.
.SH REQUIREMENTS
Python 3, amitools/xdftool and VICE/c1541.
